From 73cc7cbc3bcb32f73def00cb403dd3afa153b872 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: A6 FM bring-up <a6lte-fm@localhost>
Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 12:00:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] a6lte: integrate experimental Broadcom HCI FM

Package the separate JNI receiver backend and FMRadio, select the
Bluetooth-owned endpoint and grant only system_app socket connect.
Implement EU-band power/tune/readback/seek/scan/cancel/mute/volume
with bounded failures and rollback, plus mock-controller tests.

Use current vendor firmware without adding blobs or kernel drivers.
Requires companion patches in system/bt and packages/apps/FMRadio.
Hardware-unverified: protocol/audio assumptions are documented;
RDS/AF, recording and FM-to-Bluetooth audio remain disabled.
