-   Confirm the receiver is powered down when the FM client exits.
-
-No kernel change is currently justified for the proposed userspace HCI design.
-That is a design choice to validate, not a statement that all kernel/audio
-support has already been tested. The stock trace is the next gate; full app
-integration is not completed by these preparatory patches.
+## Implementation and remaining validation
+
+The Bluetooth-owned command endpoint, FMRadio JNI backend, device selection,
+app lifecycle, direct SEC audio path and narrow IPC policy are implemented in
+the companion patch series. No kernel radio driver or stock APK transplant is
+used. See [fm-integration.md](fm-integration.md) for implementation details.
